## Why a message has not gone out (one line under its subject)

outbox-not-sent = Ezipughị ya n'ihi na { $reason }.
outbox-retrying = Ezipubeghị ya n'ihi na { $reason }. Katna ga-anwa ọzọ n'onwe ya.
outbox-waiting-sign-in = Na-eche ka ị banye na { $address } ọzọ. Ọ ga-apụ mgbe ahụ.
outbox-waiting-password = Na-eche okwuntughe ọhụrụ nke { $address }. Ọ ga-apụ mgbe ahụ.
outbox-waiting-connection = Na-eche njikọ. Ọ ga-apụ mgbe ị laghachiri n'ịntanetị.

## Reasons, read from the mail server's answer (they follow "because")

